Description:

The vnd.fastmail.counters event parameter and the UserCounters/get JMAP
method are gone.  Both exposed the raw per-user modseq counters;
vnd.fastmail.jmapStates and UserState/get report the same information
as a JMAP data type to state string map, and remain.


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

event_extra_params no longer accepts vnd.fastmail.counters.


Upgrade instructions:

Remove vnd.fastmail.counters from event_extra_params in imapd.conf before
upgrading, and add vnd.fastmail.jmapStates if push consumers need the
per-type states.  An unknown value in event_extra_params is a fatal
configuration error, so a config that still lists it will not start.

Push consumers that read vnd.fastmail.counters must switch to
vnd.fastmail.jmapStates; JMAP clients using UserCounters/get must switch
to UserState/get.


GitHub issue:

None.
